Package: zubintest
Title: Consumer Fixture for 'zubin'
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A package in the shape every 'zubin' consumer has: it uses the
    'zubin' headers through 'LinkingTo' alone, with no 'Imports', and must
    keep working with 'zubin' uninstalled. Not for release.
